# fundctl - root-only operator control (P1-S3B: INERT SKELETON, decision D-0009).
# Installed by the operator-run provisioner to /usr/local/sbin/fundctl as root:root 0700; the ops identity cannot read or execute it.
# It recognizes exactly the eight pinned operator command names and implements none of them: every recognized command prints NOT_IMPLEMENTED and
# exits non-zero; an unknown or missing command is refused and exits non-zero. It performs no network access, reads no secret, controls no service,
# mutates no state, and never echoes its arguments.
